  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5203.02 Responsible Party",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5203.02 Responsible Party. The responsible party shall be the person or persons who causes an actual or threatened release of a hazardous material or hazardous waste, or who had custody or control of the hazardous material or hazardous waste, or both at the time of the actual or threatened release.\n\nSource. #7511, eff 6-23-01, EXPIRED: 6-23-09\n\nNew. #12614-A, eff 8-23-18",
